  "description": "Native math rendering for MarkdownRenderX.Avalonia: inline $...$ and display $$...$$ formulas are typeset by CSharpMath through SkiaSharp - no WebView, no browser, no JavaScript. A built-in compatibility layer expands LaTeX macros, rewrites align environments and maps unsupported commands, so the syntax stays close to KaTeX.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "MarkdownRenderX.Avalonia.KaTeX",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-28T05:01:07.267Z",
