  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/RYCBStudio/FluentAvalonia.MarkdownRenderer",
  "published": "2026-11-28T04:58:30.357Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "KaTeX compatibility layer: macros (\\newcommand, \\def, \\renewcommand, \\providecommand, \\gdef) are expanded, align/aligned environments are rewritten to array with a derived column count, and commands such as \\dfrac, \\textcolor, \\boxed, \\overbrace, \\xrightarrow and \\big are mapped to what the typesetter understands. Unknown commands are dropped in lenient mode so one of them cannot break a whole formula. Chinese text inside \\text{} now works through a detected system CJK font.",
